{"id": "sfusd-title-i-overpayment-offset", "title": "California recovered a $606,049 Title I overpayment from San Francisco Unified", "seconds": 56.4, "voice": "elevenlabs:exurTFaGNF2gnRcPNH8I", "narrator": "Phil", "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "8e95ae3fd564ffcc", "words": 158, "beats": [{"scene": "a", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "California promised schools money it did not have.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 2.77, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "letter", "text": "not available for allocation", "mark": "not available"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.59, 0.96, 1.38, 1.71, 1.82, 1.97, 2.16]}, {"scene": "a", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The state counted carryover alongside a federal education grant.", "t0": 2.89, "t1": 6.59, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "letter", "text": "carryover funding", "mark": "carryover"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.47, 0.86, 1.47, 2.02, 2.1, 2.46, 3.04]}, {"scene": "a", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The state budget had overstated that carryover by $88.2 million.", "t0": 6.71, "t1": 11.15, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$88.2 million", "label": "Unavailable statewide carryover"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.44, 0.86, 1.04, 1.6, 1.77, 2.33, 2.49, 2.88, 3.11, 3.32, 3.64]}, {"scene": "a", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Districts had already been told what they could spend.", "t0": 11.27, "t1": 13.66, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "letter", "text": "May 2021", "mark": "May 2021"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.45, 0.59, 0.84, 1.01, 1.34, 1.49, 1.65, 1.86]}, {"scene": "a", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "California’s education department acknowledged the miscalculation in March 2022.", "t0": 13.78, "t1": 18.51, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "letter", "text": "miscalculation", "mark": "miscalculation"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.7, 1.3, 1.8, 2.35, 2.45, 3.3, 3.44, 3.74, 4.08]}, {"scene": "a", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The state said its pandemic relief allocations used a different calculation.", "t0": 18.63, "t1": 22.53, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "letter", "text": "ESSER II and III", "mark": "ESSER"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.52, 0.77, 0.95, 1.43, 1.78, 2.4, 2.62, 2.7, 3.01]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "San Francisco Unified received over thirteen million dollars.", "t0": 22.75, "t1": 25.99, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$13,254,641", "label": "District payment before correction"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.27, 0.81, 1.31, 1.71, 1.95, 2.39, 2.73]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Then California cut the district’s entitlement.", "t0": 26.11, "t1": 28.66, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$12,648,592", "label": "Revised final district entitlement"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.33, 0.93, 1.14, 1.24, 1.64]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The difference was $606,049.", "t0": 28.78, "t1": 32.09, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$606,049", "label": "District overpayment"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.54, 0.74, 1.0, 1.33, 1.58, 2.01, 2.5]}, {"scene": "c", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "In March, the state explained how it would recover the money.", "t0": 32.31, "t1": 35.17, "shot": "s9", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "letter", "text": "March 2022 Principal Apportionment", "mark": "March 2022"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.74, 0.89, 1.17, 1.68, 1.84, 1.93, 2.11, 2.45, 2.57]}, {"scene": "c", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The state took the difference out of another payment.", "t0": 35.29, "t1": 37.64, "shot": "s10", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "recover", "text": "Offset", "mark": "Offset"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.5, 0.72, 0.86, 1.36, 1.55, 1.66, 1.96]}, {"scene": "c", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The district’s invoice column shows zero.", "t0": 37.76, "t1": 40.09, "shot": "s11", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$0", "label": "Amount invoiced to SFUSD"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.57, 0.98, 1.38, 1.68]}, {"scene": "c", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The state told districts to reduce the federal revenue on their books.", "t0": 40.21, "t1": 43.41, "shot": "s12", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "letter", "text": "abatement", "mark": "abatement"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.49, 0.72, 1.16, 1.3, 1.66, 1.79, 2.16, 2.51, 2.59, 2.75]}, {"scene": "c", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Its letter identifies the accounting codes for that entry.", "t0": 43.53, "t1": 46.51, "shot": "s13", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "letter", "text": "Object 8290", "mark": "8290"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.24, 0.54, 1.11, 1.22, 1.7, 1.99, 2.12, 2.31]}, {"scene": "c", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Which school budgets absorbed the change remains an open question.", "t0": 46.63, "t1": 50.31, "shot": "s14", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "letter", "text": "prior expenditures", "mark": "expenditures"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.37, 0.74, 1.15, 1.58, 1.69, 2.16, 2.52, 2.65, 2.95]}, {"scene": "c", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The county education office has its own, separate entry.", "t0": 50.43, "t1": 53.04, "shot": "s15", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$16,878", "label": "Separate county office offset"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.4, 0.9, 1.21, 1.38, 1.53, 1.85, 2.21]}, {"scene": "c", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 53.16, "t1": 55.53, "shot": "end", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.32, 0.72, 0.94, 1.27, 1.38, 1.49, 1.76, 2.01]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"a": "The statewide calculation", "b": "San Francisco’s correction", "c": "How the state recovered it"}, "look": "newsroom", "hook": "question"}